  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desk Appraisal of Danish Support to the UNEP-DHI Centre &#x2013; Supporting Climate Action in the 2030 Agenda through Sustainable Water Management (2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy contract concerning a desk appraisal of the Danish support of UNEP-DHI Centre 2022-2025</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the appraisal is to assess the relevance, quality and feasibility of the programme design and documentation and if they are fit to underpin programme implementation and produce the expected results in an effective, efficient and sustainable manner, as well as providing recommendations for adjustments or improvements as needed, prior to submission to the grant authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
